title: The Economic Crisis
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: crisis_urgency >= 1 and crisis_program_timer = 0 and economic_plan = 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1
frequency: 200
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; crisis_program_timer = 5
card-image: img/rebuildingplan.jpg
tags: party_affairs, govt_affairs

= Addressing the Economic Crisis

Our party is divided upon how to solve the ongoing fallout of the Elro crisis. The destruction cannot be properly explained through words , the entire city of Abarle upon the mountain has been erased and with it many historical and cultural landmarks.

The Vynarians are out of their jobs as their places of employment burned and homeless as those too have been wiped out. Before us stands the costliest reconstruction we can imagine but with it a chance to forever reshape our largest city (or what remains of it) to our image and with it the entirety of Kadja.

On one side the Neo-Forsvollrists surrounding Annastasia are loudly propagating her own brainchild for what the city should look like. It bears stark ressemblance to her homeland of Yoake and would indeed turn the city into a new Yoake together with the revival of the Yoaken culture this could help our polling extremely well but the perceived erasure of local culture could make us many , many enemies.

On the other hand the more moderate socialists , humanists and liberals are calling for a reconstruction which would respect the original city and its culture. This of course wouldnt provide us with a entire new loyal support base but perhaps its better to play it safe here.

- @support_traditional: Support the Traditional solution.
- @support_yoakumaen: Support the Yoakumaen solution.

@support_yoakumaen
subtitle: Call for a radical reconstruction of the city. Centre of Kaddu! Centre of Altera!
unavailable-subtitle: The factions supporting this do not have enough power.
choose-if: historical_mode == 0 or (neoforsvollrist_strength >= socialist_strength and neoforsvollrist_strength >= humanist_strength and neoforsvollrist_strength >= constitutionalist_strength)
on-arrival: socialist_dissent += 10; humanist_dissent += 5; liberal_strength += 5; wtb_support += 1;
go-to: plan_adopted if wtb_support >= 3; plan_support if wtb_support < 3

@plan_support

We are hosting rallies and having speeches on the importance for a radical reconstruction of the city. More work needs to be done.

@plan_adopted
on-arrival: wtb_adopted = 1; neoforsvollrist_dissent -= 15; constitutionalist_dissent -= 10; neoforsvollrist_strength += 10; humanist_strength -= 10; humanist_dissent += 20; socialist_dissent += 5; economic_plan = 1; yoakumaen_adopted = 1

With our hard work we have finally managed to use our position to convince the party to adopt the Yoakumaen reconstruction plan. [? if kcp_in_government == 1 : We can begin implementing the reconstruction plan as soon as possible, as long as we have the Economic or Finance ministries. ?][? if kcp_in_government = 0 : We can emphasize our plan for reconstruction in electoral propaganda. ?]

@support_traditional
subtitle: Call for a faithful reconstruction of Vynaria.
unavailable-subtitle: The traditionalist factions are not strong enough.
choose-if: historical_mode == 0 or ((socialist_strength + humanist_strength + liberal_strength) >= neoforsvollrist_strength and (socialist_strength + humanist_strength + liberal_strength) >= constitutionalist_strength)
on-arrival: socialist_strength += 10; neoforsvollrist_dissent += 5; constitutionalist_dissent += 5; nationalization_support += 2
go-to: support_left_progress if nationalization_support < 3; adopt_left if nationalization_support >= 3

@support_left_progress

We are hosting speeches and rallies to support the idea of modest but culturaly faithful reconstruction. This could be the renesaince of Kaddian culture!

@adopt_left
on-arrival: socialist_strength += 15; socialist_dissent -= 10; neoforsvollrist_dissent += 10; constitutionalist_dissent += 8; nationalization_adopted = 1; economic_plan = 3; traditional_adopted = 1

With our hard work we have convinced the rest of the party to drop their delusions of granduer and pursue a faithful Kadjan plan! [? if kcp_in_government == 1 : We can begin implementing the plan as soon as possible, as long as we have the Economic or Finance ministries. ?] [? if kcp_in_government == 0 : Without a position to implement the plan we will probably not get the support we expected from it as this is the plan other parties will implement anyways. ?]

